      "text": "Step 3: Use the trigonometric identity for cosine of supplementary angles.\n\\[\n\\cos(180^\\circ - \\theta) = -\\cos(\\theta)\n\\]\nThus,\n\\[\n\\cos \\angle RPS = -\\cos \\angle RPQ\n\\]",
