      "step_number": 5,
      "text": "Step 5: Since \\(\\angle RPQ\\) is an angle in a right triangle where the opposite side to \\(\\angle RPQ\\) is shorter than the adjacent side, \\(\\angle RPQ\\) must be acute, thus \\(\\cos \\angle RPQ\\) is positive.\n\\[\n\\cos \\angle RPQ = \\frac{24}{25}\n\\]",
